    "description": "Triggers a Will Test vs. target’s Will Test. On a success, the caster possesses the target, inhabits its body, gains full control over it, and full access to its memories and knowledge. Once per week, the target may repeat the Test to break free. Can be ended by exorcism. If the host does not have access to magic and the Blood School, the caster cannot use them either. If the caster is expelled from the body, the host vomits the caster out and loses consciousness, and the caster is Stunned for two turns.",
